Kokoro-82M offline text-to-speech — bundled model assets
=========================================================

The model weights, voice packs, and tokenizer shipped in this directory are
downloaded at build time from:

    onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX   (Apache-2.0)
    https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX

which is the ONNX export of the upstream model:

    hexgrad/Kokoro-82M                    (Apache-2.0)
    https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M

Both the code and the model WEIGHTS are licensed under Apache-2.0 — the upstream
model card states: "With Apache-licensed weights, Kokoro can be deployed
anywhere." This permits commercial redistribution inside the Mythos Writer
installer.

Training-data attribution
-------------------------
A small portion (~a few hours) of Kokoro's training data derives from CC-BY
corpora (e.g. Koniwa / SIWIS). This imposes an ATTRIBUTION requirement only —
there is no non-commercial restriction on the resulting weights. Attribution is
satisfied by this notice and the upstream model card.

Runtime dependencies (not bundled here, installed via npm)
----------------------------------------------------------
    onnxruntime-web   MIT        — WASM inference runtime
    phonemizer        Apache-2.0 — grapheme-to-phoneme

Full Apache-2.0 text: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
